约化: u=rho/2; nu_B ∝ sin^2 u e^{-B(1-cos u)} du/u;  B=beta*cos(theta/2)
      Q=H_vv/beta = c*g(u), g=sin u/(2u)>0;  G=<A0>=E[g] in (0,1/2);  F=<Phi''> >= 1/6
      c_tot = (c/2)G(B) + F(B)/beta ;   c_inf = c/4 = cos(theta/2)/4

